msgstr "Aha ụdị ngwaọrụ a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Nkwupụta Aha Njirimara"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Nke a bụ mkpali aha njirimara a ga-ekwekọ na nbanye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Arịrịọ Okwuntụghe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Nke a bụ mkpali okwuntụghe a ga-ekwekọ na nbanye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Faịlụ nhazi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Nke a bụ ebe nkịtị faịlụ nhazi dị na ngwaọrụ dị anya. A na-eji ya maka usoro SCP na SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Depụtaghachi TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Nke a bụ ederede CLI eji ezipụ ndabere na sava tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Iwu Njide"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Iwu nhọrọ nke a na-echekwa nsonaazụ ya dịka nhazi, kama idetụ ya na sava TFTP. Ọ na-agba mgbe niile site na SSH, n'agbanyeghị Ụdị Njikọ, ngwaọrụ ahụ adịghịkwa mkpa sava TFTP. Hapụ ya n'efu maka ngwaọrụ ndị na-edepụta nhazi ha na TFTP. Ọmụmaatụ maka MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Gosi Ụdị"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Nke a bụ ederede CLI eji egosipụta ụdị dị ugbu a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Ajụjụ Nkwenye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Nke a bụ mkpali nkwenye a ga-adaba tupu ezipu ya."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Kwenye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Enwere arịrịọ nkwenye maka iṅomi nhazi ahụ?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Manye Nkwenye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Enwere arịrịọ nkwenye mmanye maka iṅomi nhazi ahụ?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Lelee Ọgwụgwụ na Nhazi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Lelee ọgwụgwụ na nhazi?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Mkpalite Igodo Ọ Bụla"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Ederede ga-adakọrọ na ntuziaka ụdị 'Pịa Igodo Ọ Bụla Iji Gaa n'ihu'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Ntụziaka Mgbe E Binyere N'ime"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Abụọ ajụjụ/nzaghachi nhọrọ e zigara ozugbo nbanye gasịrị, tupu iwu nṅomi-na-TFTP, otu n'ahịrị dịka prompt|response. A na-ejikọta ajụjụ ahụ dịka okwu mgbe niile na-adịghị echebara mkpụrụedemede ukwu ma ọ bụ obere echiche megide mmepụta ngwaọrụ (ya mere ọ nweghị ike inwe | n'onwe ya, a ga-agbanahụkwa nkwado na mkpụrụedemede pụrụ iche ndị ọzọ, dịka Save \\[y/n\\]), a na-ezigakwa nzaghachi ahụ dịka e si pịnye ya, ma ọ bụ jiri <CR> iji zipu naanị nlaghachi ụgbọ. A na-eziga nzaghachi naanị otu ugboro mgbe a hụchara ajụjụ ya, ma na nzaghachi nke nzaghachi gara aga ma ọ bụ na mmepụta emechara; ma ọ bụghị ya, a na-edekọ ịdọ aka ná ntị ma ọ dịghị ihe a na-eziga. A na-aza ndị a na mbụ; a na-aza ajụjụ Any Key dị n'elu emechaa, mgbe a na-agbanye ngwaọrụ ahụ, ya mere ajụjụ a zara ebe a anaghị erute Any Key. Ọmụmaatụ: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Ntọala Izugbe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Ọnọdụ Ngosi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Ekwesịrị igosi Nhazi Router na Console ma ọ bụ na Taabụ Elu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Kọnsọlụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Taabụ Elu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Ahịrị Okwu Nchọpụta Ihe Dị Iche na Nhazi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ ndabara nke ahịrị ndị a na-agbanweghị iji gosipụta tupu na mgbe mgbanwe ọ bụla gasịrị mgbe a na-atụnyere nkwado ndabere abụọ. Uru ka ukwuu na-eme ka ọ dị mfe ịhụ gburugburu nhazi dị nso. Enwere ike ịgbanwe nke a maka ntụnyere ọ bụla na peeji Tụnyere."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Oge njikọ agwụla"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Oge kacha elu a ga-echere na sekọnd mgbe a na-eguzobe njikọ netwọk mbụ na ngwaọrụ. A na-ahapụ ngwaọrụ kwụsịrị ma ọ bụ nke a na-apụghị iru mgbe oge a gwụchara ka ọrụ ndabere e haziri hazi wee gaa n'ihu na ngwaọrụ ndị fọdụrụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Mechie n'apụghị"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na a kaa ya akara, mgbe a na-emechi njikọ ngwaọrụ, a naghị enye iwu 'exit'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Nchekwa Nwa Oge Njikọ Nchọpụta Mperi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Ma a ga-edekọ mmepụta ozugbo nke njikọ ngwaọrụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Were ya na ebuliri ngwaọrụ niile elu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Ma a ga-eche na ngwaọrụ niile nwere ikike dị elu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Elekere Nbudata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Elekere nke ụbọchị iji mee nbudata zuru ezu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Nhazi Oge Ịnwa Ọzọ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Oge a ga-echere tupu ịgbalị imezu nbudata ọzọ mgbe nbudata e haziri dara"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Oge Nchekwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ ụbọchị iji debe nkwado ndabere ochie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Debe Nchekwa Azụ Ngwaọrụ Na-adịghị Arụ Ọrụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
