#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Ndekọ dị n'ime nwere ụbọchị"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Tinye obere folda dabere na ụbọchị n'ime ụzọ ebe nchekwa (tupu folda nke ngwaọrụ ọ bụla), ka e wee chekwaa ọsọ ọ bụla n'okpuru ụbọchị nkwado ya, dịka .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Gbanyụrụ na-echekwa nhazi dị ugbu a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Ụzọ SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Mgbe ị na-eji SCP, ịhapụ nke a oghere ga-eji modul SCP nke PHP nke na-anaghị arụ ọrụ mgbe niile. A gbanyụrụ SCP dị na mpụga mgbe a gbanyere nkwenye igodo onye nnabata SSH n'ihi na ọ nweghị ike iji njikọ enwetara nkwenye ọzọ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Nyochaa Igodo Onye nnabata SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Dekọọ igodo onye nnabata SSH nke ngwaọrụ ọ bụla na njikọ mbụ ma jụ izipu nzere ma ọ bụrụ na ọ gbanwee ma emechaa. Ọnọdụ SSH/Telnet agaghị alaghachi na Telnet mgbe agbanyere nkwenye. Mgbe mgbanwe igodo ziri ezi gasịrị, jiri omume ngwaọrụ kpochapụ igodo onye nnabata echekwara."

