#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Tinye Ọdịiche Nhazi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Tinye diff dị n'otu nke ngwaọrụ ọ bụla nhazi ya gbanwere n'oge ọrụ ahụ na Ozi-e nchekwa, ka onye nyocha nwee ike ịhụ kpọmkwem ihe gbanwere. A na-awụfe nhazi binary (ndị na-abụghị ederede). A na-eleghara ahịrị na-agbanwe agbanwe na nchekwa ọ bụla anya mgbe nile (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' na 'Current configuration :', na NX-OS '!Time:' na '!Running configuration last done at:'). Ịdọ aka ná ntị: a na-eziga diff ahụ n'ederede doro anya nye onye ọ bụla natara Ozi-e ahụ, ya mere o nwere ike ikpughe nhazi kwesịrị ịdị na nzuzo; hapụ Tinye Ihe Nzuzo na Diffs ka ọ bụrụ nke a na-akaghị akara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Tinye Ihe Nzuzo n'ime Ọdịiche"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Ziga ọnụọgụ nzuzo dị na diff e zigara n'ozi-e ka ha dị. Mgbe ewepụrụ akara (nke ndabara), a na-achọta ahịrị ndị gbanwere na nhazi izizi ma bipụta ha n'ụzọ e zoro ezo, na-emechi ma ọ daa: ahịrị ndị nwere okwu dị ka nzuzo (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) na ahịrị onye nnabata na onye ọrụ SNMP ka a na-ebelata ruo okwu mbụ ha nke &lt;secret hidden&gt; na-eso, na ahịrị ọ bụla nke ngọngọ PEM, asambodo ma ọ bụ ngọngọ eriri igodo, ma ọ bụ ọnụọgụ e kwuru n'ọtụtụ ahịrị, na ahịrị hex ma ọ bụ base64 ọ bụla, na-ezobe; ngọngọ na-adịghị agwụ agwụ na-ezobe akụkụ fọdụrụ nke nhazi ahụ. Nke a na-ezobekwa ahịrị ndị na-adịghị emerụ ahụ (dịka nkọwa na-akpọ igodo), mana ahịrị ọ bụla gbanwere ka na-egosi, nwee akara (changed) mgbe naanị akụkụ zoro ezo ya dị iche, ma e debe ngọngọ na-adịghị agwụ agwụ n'ime Ozi-e ahụ. A naghị agbanwe nchekwa ndabere echekwara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Ụkpụrụ Ewepụrụ na Diff"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Okwu mgbe niile nhọrọ (otu n'ahịrị) na-adakọrịta na ahịrị nhazi a ga-eleghara anya mgbe a na-atụnyere, ka ahịrị na-agbanwe agbanwe dịka akara oge ma ọ bụ nọmba nsonazụ ghara ịpụta dịka mgbanwe. A na-ejikọta ụkpụrụ ọ bụla n'enweghị nchebara mkpụrụedemede ukwu ma ọ bụ obere ebe ọ bụla n'ahịrị ọ gwụla ma ejiri ^ ma ọ bụ $ kwụsie ya; a na-eleghara ụkpụrụ na-abụghị okwu mgbe niile ziri ezi anya."

